            "repoId": "excalidraw",
            "text": "Trace how an element in the scene actually gets drawn onto the canvas: which React component invokes the static-scene render function, and where does the rendering code obtain (or generate) the roughjs shape it draws?",
            "category": "GRAPH_HEAVY",
            "goldFacts": [
